Major Industries/Crops/Minerals
  
  
  
Industries     : Steel Plant, Heavy Water Project, Coach  Repairing
                 Workshop, Aluminum Smelter, Fertilisers
  
Crops          : Rice, Groundnut, Soyabean, Pulses, Jute, Mesta,
                 Sugar-cane, Coconut, Turmeric, Forest  Products:
                 Sal, Teak, Rosewood, Lac, Tusser, Silk, Medinic-
                 inal Plants, Tendu Leaves
  
Minerals       : Iron Ore, Manganese Ore, Cromite, Coal, Bauxite,
                 Lime   Stone,   Quartz,   Quartzite,    Granite,
                 Dolomite, Fire Clay, Nickel Ore, Mineral  Sands,
                 Semi Precious Stones.
  
----
Financial Incentives
  
  
  
-   Investment  subsidy @ 10 to 25% of the  fixed  capital  costs
    ranging  between  Rs.1 million to 2.5 million  for  specified
    locations.
-   Subsidy as technical know-how fee upto Rs.0.2 million.
  
^^
----
Fiscal Concessions
  
  
  
-   Exemption/  deferment  of Sales Tax on  finished  goods  for
    periods ranging between 7 to 9 years.
-   Exemption from electricity duty.
-   Exemption from octroi duty/entry toll.
  
Others
-   Single Window Clearing agency
-   Entrepreneur Assistance cell
  
